  "controlsRationale": "Tab and Enter select Play then Single Player. Hold Aim / Shoot (original right mouse button), move the right mouse stick, then release to take a penalty. The left arrow pad chooses goalkeeper areas; Enter skips reaction pauses. Source input behavior preserved.",
  "sourcePatches": [
    {
      "path": "SOURCE_PATCH.diff",
      "files": [
        {
          "file": "proj/src/Bitmap.h",
          "originalSha256": "fae75f7b9bf5ed7047e7a2b63127ed562f3a3da9e4f5397baa6182f955a8508d",
          "patchedSha256": "34fc642b534cb3e73130d02cfdc96c124a64f3d095d11865c047ffb776d21fcd",
          "reason": "Restore the owning typed drawing declarations. Give Bitmap its existing struct layout a tag so the original circular headers can forward-declare the type in either include order. Without the prototypes, calls use an incompatible implicit-int/varargs ABI and trap in the browser menu.",
          "verification": "Actual original browser .Ldraw_bitmap_bitcast_invalid trap and original actual Menu.c -Werror=implicit-function-declaration fail; corrected actual-caller compile and both public-header orders pass. Real touch right-button gesture shoots the ball and animates player/goalkeeper."
        },
        {
          "file": "proj/src/video_gr.h",
          "originalSha256": "7637b06353362b3ca4a881fd6b51f66bde64258a5b3e81bd3fc31b000516b362",
          "patchedSha256": "d37ab32d7ffc511fdaff22a79e09461d994e0c8a4177d35ca3cec2d0f3a70836",
          "reason": "Restore the owning typed drawing declarations. Give Bitmap its existing struct layout a tag so the original circular headers can forward-declare the type in either include order. Without the prototypes, calls use an incompatible implicit-int/varargs ABI and trap in the browser menu.",
          "verification": "Actual original browser .Ldraw_bitmap_bitcast_invalid trap and original actual Menu.c -Werror=implicit-function-declaration fail; corrected actual-caller compile and both public-header orders pass. Real touch right-button gesture shoots the ball and animates player/goalkeeper."
        },
        {
          "file": "proj/src/Bitmap.c",
          "originalSha256": "b951c097df7419c1e733887b4fe46162abbb1d2c52f80f9313b2aef172b4cea2",
          "patchedSha256": "c35752b34f8fa00be4fc963b9722e2fac010713cb06bfd4b87d53dcdcbb72b55",
          "reason": "Check an absent ball bitmap before reading its dimensions and return no collision (zero), matching the renderer result consumed by Ball.c. The original dereferenced NULL then used a bare return in an int function, rejected by Android Clang.",
          "verification": "Original actual-source NULL ball render regression exitsSIGSEGV; fixed returns0 without buffer changes, preserves opaque collision/draw and transparent no-collision behavior. Evidence build/arcade-100/c/penaltix-null-{red,green}.log; original NDK error penaltix-native-build.log."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "artwork": {
    "icon": "Original blue football sprite enlarged with nearest-neighbor pixels over a simple pitch background."
  }
